        </div>
        <p class="ins-tier">The deeper end</p>
        <p class="ins-name">A dedicated travel-medical plan built for serious care and evacuation abroad</p>
        <p class="ins-why">Stronger on medical care and evacuation, for a remote or higher-risk trip where that is the real exposure.</p>
        <div class="ins-foot">
          <span class="pickcta">
            {ext(insMedical).target && (
              <a class="pickbtn" href={insMedical} {...ext(insMedical)}>See a travel-medical plan<span class="arw">&#8594;</span><NewTab /></a>
            )}
